Yiwen wass, tacinwit tettnadi argaz-is deg lɣaci, war-t. Akka i d-tenulfa-d tafyirt "irgazen akk d amyalan".
Yiwen wumezweg yesteqsa tameṭṭut-is: Nniɣ-am tikkelt belli tesnulfaḍ akli? Xaṭi, iwacu? Ihi acuɣer i tettεawadeḍ?
Yiwen wumejji yeqqar ihenna i umezweg n tarwa taynayt. Tameṭṭut testeqsa acuɣer ur t-yenni ara. M'ara yeṛǧiw uḥriq, ttεawaden i umesswiy, mačči i tesbaḥt!
Yiwen wilef yemsagar akked wergaz deg webḥeṛ n usnaḍi. D acu-as-yenna? Ay, s wagi i tteccḍ?
Tameṭṭut i wergaz-is: Acuɣer tsɣiḍ afsi? Ur tesεiḍ ara tikkarabt! D acu, kečč tesɣiḍ isutinen...
Yiwet n teqcict tessawal-iyi: As ɣur-i, ulac win yellan. Zuzreɣ ɣur-s, ssaweɣ, maca ulac win yellan.
Yiwet n teqcict i weqcic: Tanemmirt fell-ak ɣef yiḍ-nni ijehden! Maca... ur nelli ara akked iḍelli! D ayen kan!
Aḥanut n tsedwit d amkan iεejben! Ma tettwaṭṭfeḍ krad n tikkal, ttefkeɣ-ak aεexriḍ.
Yemma testeqsa mmi-s d acu-t axeddim yeḥmel ugar. Awal, axaṭer nekk daɣen ttekmiḍeɣ tiɣawsiwin ur nesεi azal.
Yiwen izuɣur asertay iwakken ad d-yini belli snat n teqcicin ttnaɣent fell-as. Asertay yesteqsa d acu-t wugur. Aqcic yerra-d: D tacmit i ireḥḥan!
Aẓru n webar yesnulfu-d asemmi, aẓru n texxamt n učči yesnulfu-d laẓ... maca ur naf ara asaggan, isnulfu tirga.
Teẓriḍ acuɣer ameɣras iḍeḥḥek m'ara yuraren? Axaṭer aḥcic yesserfeḍ-as izmarn!
